# Wrong output (PLAN.md): a parameter load is read as the whole
# parameter whatever its offset, so the guard compares a value with
# itself, is true, and the store runs on all 64 threads.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/micro/param_fields.ptx | FileCheck "%s"
CHECK: kernel micro_param_fields
CHECK: st.global.u32  global store 4 B (predicated)
CHECK: totals per CTA [static]:
CHECK: global bytes: load 0 B, store 256 B
